        <form id="quizForm">
          <div class="question"><b>Q1. What is the difference between == and ===?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> === checks value + type, == checks value only</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> Both are same</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> == is assign</label><label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> === is assign</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q2. Which one adds item at END of array?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> push()</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> pop()</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> shift()</label><label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> splice()</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q3. How to get element by ID and change text?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="a"> document.getElementById("id").innerText = "New";</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="b"> document.getId("id").text = "New";</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="c"> getElement("id").innerText = "New";</label><label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="d"> document.id.innerText = "New";</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q4. Which loop runs a fixed number of times?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="a"> for (let i=0; i&lt;5; i++)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="b"> if loop</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="c"> function loop</label><label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="d"> return loop</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q5. How to save object in LocalStorage?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="a"> localStorage.setItem("user", JSON.stringify(user))</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="b"> localStorage.setItem("user", user)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="c"> localStorage.save(user)</label><label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="d"> localStorage.set(user)</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q6. Which timer runs again and again?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="a"> setInterval()</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="b"> setTimeout()</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="c"> clearTimeout()</label><label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="d"> setTimer()</label></div>
          <div class="question"><b>Q7. What does Math.floor(Math.random() * 10) give?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="a"> Random whole number 0 to 9</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="b"> Random decimal 0 to 10</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="c"> Always 10</label><label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="d"> Always 0</label></div>
