          <div class="question"><b>Q9. What is the correct project pattern?</b><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="a"> Data First - Change data - Call show function - Save - Events update data</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="b"> HTML only, no data</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="c"> Save first, no show</label><label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="d"> Events only, no data</label></div>
